<title>DUBAI: MashreqBank in record 1996 profit, flat dividend.</title>
<headline>MashreqBank in record 1996 profit, flat dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million dirhams unless stated)</p>
<p> Share (in dirhams)			   64.6	vs	59.8</p>
